{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50382","headline":"句 · 荣九思","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹青饰成庆，玉帛擅专诸。\n（见《资治通监》卷一九一《唐纪七》武德七年六月壬戌下胡三省注。\n）（见《资治通监考异》卷九。\n）（〖1〗《资治通监》胡三省注引《实录》云：「元吉见秦王有大功，每怀妬害，言论丑恶，谮害日甚。\n每谓建成曰：『当爲大哥手刃之。\n』建成性颇仁厚，初止之。\n元吉数言不已，建成後亦许之。\n元吉因令速发，遂与建成各募壮士，多匿罪人，赏赐之，图行不轨。\n其记室荣九思爲诗以剌之曰：『丹青饰成庆，玉帛擅专诸。\n』而弗悟也。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"荣九思","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50382.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50382","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}